112: * Since ADR-0037 N5 a KPI value carries `kpiUnit`, which decides instead: this set then only (a) reads a value sent
113: * WITHOUT `kpiUnit` (the member is optional until T-DG4-KBE-R8 makes it required) and (b) recognizes a percentage
114: * label that is only the sign. It never applies to the unit of a value that has a `kpiUnit`.
